# ElectroFix AI

## AI Assistant for Electronic Repair

ElectroFix AI is an intelligent assistant designed to help electronic technicians diagnose and repair electronic devices.

### Features
- Diagnose electronic circuit problems.
- Troubleshoot power supply boards.
- Help repair vacuum cleaners.
- Help repair irons and hair dryers.
- Explain electronic components and ICs.
- Provide step-by-step repair instructions.
- Guide technicians in using a multimeter.
- Identify common electronic faults.

### Goal
Our goal is to make electronic repair easier, faster, and more accurate with the help of Artificial Intelligence.

